[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429257\">4450B02</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429683\">7055B90</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429398\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429401\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428852\">1008A42</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the gearbox rear cover.</p><p>2. Cut the sealant.</p><p>3. Remove the gearbox rear cover.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the manual gearbox and\ndifferential oil in a suitable container.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044567.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Cleanany residues of sealant from  the\nmatching surfaces between the gearbox rear cover and the gearbox.</p><p>Apply the recommended sealant to the matching\nsurfaces between the gearbox rear cover and the gearbox.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Silicon sealant</p></td><td><p>GEARBOX REAR COVER</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Place the gearbox rear cover (1a) in its housing and fasten it\nby tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>GEARBOX REAR COVER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Gearbox side) 0.5 ÷ 0.6</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044568.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428852\">1008A42</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429401\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429398\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429683\">7055B90</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429257\">4450B02</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the manual gearbox and differential \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428827\">0010T41</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]